    {
      "title": "Reservation Quotas",
      "requirements": "The desk agrees a supply allowance with each project lead. The lead records it as the team quota. One unit is one standard pack, such as a plywood blank or a bundle of wire. This ledger tracks the allowance and the packs the team has asked the desk to set aside.\n\nEach team starts with quota 0 and no material reservations. A quota limits the total number of packs reserved across all materials for one team. Reservations belong to the team, so granting or revoking access does not change them. Material names are non-empty ASCII strings. Compare them exactly as written. Quotas, amounts, and deltas are integers.\n\nset_quota(team_id, actor, quota) sets the team's quota and returns True. Return False if the team does not exist, the actor is not the owner, or the quota is below the sum of its current reservations. A quota of zero is valid when the team has no reservations.\n\nchange_reservation(team_id, actor, material, delta) changes that material's amount by delta. The owner and additional members can make this change. A positive delta reserves units. A negative delta releases them. Return False if the team is missing, the actor does not have access, delta is zero, the new material amount would be negative, or the total would exceed the team's quota. Otherwise apply the change and return True.\n\nreservation(team_id, actor, material) returns the reserved amount for the material, or 0 if no units of it are reserved. available(team_id, actor) returns quota minus the sum of current reservations. Both return None if the team is missing or actor does not have access.",
      "visible": [
        {
          "id": "reserve-and-release",
          "kind": "requirements",
          "steps": [
            {"method":"register_team","args":["wood","lee"],"expected":true},
            {"method":"available","args":["wood","lee"],"expected":0},
            {"method":"set_quota","args":["wood","lee",6],"expected":true},
            {"method":"grant_access","args":["wood","lee","kim"],"expected":true},
            {"method":"change_reservation","args":["wood","kim","plywood",4],"expected":true},
            {"method":"reservation","args":["wood","lee","plywood"],"expected":4},
            {"method":"change_reservation","args":["wood","lee","plywood",-1],"expected":true},
            {"method":"available","args":["wood","kim"],"expected":3}
          ]
        },
