    {
      "title": "Atomic Reservations",
      "requirements": "The wood team wants two cedar blanks in place of two pine blanks. The desk must release the pine and reserve the cedar as one request. If the cedar change fails, the pine reservation stays in place.\n\ntransact(team_id, actor, changes) tries a list of reservation changes as one operation. Each entry is a [material, delta] list with the same argument types as change_reservation. Repeated materials are allowed. Return False for a missing team, an actor without access, or an empty change list.\n\nCheck entries in their list order. Each entry must meet all change_reservation rules using the temporary state from earlier entries. Check the quota and the material amount after every entry. A later entry cannot make an earlier invalid entry valid.\n\nIf an entry fails, return False and restore the reservations to their state before the transaction. If all entries succeed, apply the final amounts and return True. Transactions do not change team membership or quota.",
      "visible": [
        {
          "id": "release-before-reserving",
          "kind": "requirements",
          "steps": [
            {"method":"register_team","args":["wood","lee"],"expected":true},
            {"method":"set_quota","args":["wood","lee",5],"expected":true},
            {"method":"change_reservation","args":["wood","lee","pine",5],"expected":true},
            {"method":"transact","args":["wood","lee",[["pine",-2],["cedar",2]]],"expected":true},
            {"method":"reservation","args":["wood","lee","pine"],"expected":3},
            {"method":"reservation","args":["wood","lee","cedar"],"expected":2},
            {"method":"available","args":["wood","lee"],"expected":0}
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "later-failure-rolls-back-earlier-write",
          "kind": "state",
          "steps": [
