    {
      "title": "Team Merges",
      "requirements": "A project lead registered the same build twice. The desk keeps the record on the collection sheet. It moves the other record's reservations and members into that record.\n\nmerge_teams(target_id, source_id, actor) combines two existing teams. The team IDs must differ and the actor must own both teams. The target's quota and owner stay the same. If the combined total across all reservations would exceed the target's existing quota, return False. The source's quota never adds to the target's quota.\n\nOn success, sum the reserved amounts for each material, keep every additional member from either team, and remove the source team and its quota. A person who was a member of both teams remains a single member. Return True. Other teams stay unchanged.\n\nAny invalid merge returns False and changes neither team. The removed ID can be registered again as a fresh team with no members, no reservations, and quota 0.",
      "visible": [
        {
          "id": "merge-sums-reservations-and-members",
          "kind": "requirements",
          "steps": [
            {"method":"register_team","args":["wood","lee"],"expected":true},
            {"method":"register_team","args":["carving","lee"],"expected":true},
            {"method":"set_quota","args":["wood","lee",7],"expected":true},
            {"method":"set_quota","args":["carving","lee",10],"expected":true},
            {"method":"change_reservation","args":["wood","lee","oak",3],"expected":true},
            {"method":"change_reservation","args":["carving","lee","oak",2],"expected":true},
            {"method":"change_reservation","args":["carving","lee","cedar",2],"expected":true},
            {"method":"grant_access","args":["carving","lee","kim"],"expected":true},
            {"method":"merge_teams","args":["wood","carving","lee"],"expected":true},
            {"method":"reservation","args":["wood","kim","oak"],"expected":5},
            {"method":"reservation","args":["wood","kim","cedar"],"expected":2},
            {"method":"available","args":["wood","kim"],"expected":0},
            {"method":"has_access","args":["carving","lee"],"expected":false}
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "quota-failure-is-atomic",
